  "description": "Garret O’Bric Property Advisors are delighted to present this spacious and bright 2 bedroom ground floor apartment to the market. \nThe Headlands is a much sought after well-established modern development situated in a great location off the Putland Road.\n\nAccommodation briefly comprises entrance hall, exceptionally large open plan living room/kitchen and dining room which leads out onto a private rear patio balcony. \nTwo large double bedrooms with built in wardrobes in both and a bright generously sized bathroom. \n\nThe grounds of the Headlands are superbly well maintained with lots of green space and offer ample parking for resident’s use.\nSituated in walking distance of all the amenities that Bray town has to offer, including the DART Station, Seafront, \nshops, schools and public transport. \nViewing is highly recommended.\n",
